{"Title":"An Act relative to chapter 15A","BillNumber":"H4286","DocketNumber":"HD4525","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"WMS1","Name":"William M. Straus","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WMS1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-15T10:05:58.463"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"WMS1","Name":"William M. Straus","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WMS1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-15T10:05:58.4633333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4286/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Straus of Mattapoisett, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of William M. Straus relative to the optional retirement program for certain employees of public higher education institutions.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSection 1. Section 40 of chapter 15A of the General Laws, as appearing in 2014 Official Edition is hereby amended, in line 125, by inserting after the word “requirements;” the following words:- provided that notwithstanding the previous provisions, chapter thirty-two of the General Laws, or of any general or special law to the contrary any eligible employee employed on a part-time basis on July 1, 2016 who had elected to participate in the optional retirement program shall be eligible to re-elect membership in the state employees' retirement system if their employment became full-time in any eligible position within a public institution of higher education prior to October 1, 2016. The employee may also purchase their prior employment while a participant of the option retirement program as creditable service, conditioned upon the payment, in 1 lump sum or in installments upon such terms as the state retirement board may provide;\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}